 ### Local Bundle Adjustment
-Joint optimization of poses and 3D Gaussians for a selected subset of keyframes, optimized for GPU efficiency using fixed landmark sets and sparse Jacobians [S2]. Bootstrap: Exhaustively match first 8 well-connected keyframes. Rectify outliers using Lambda Twist (GPU minimal P3P solver for RANSAC). Initialize poses, focal length, and landmarks using Depth Anything 3. Select $N=20$ keyframes using Greedy Graph Traversal. Select $K=10000$ landmarks via multinomial sampling based on observation count, from landmarks observed by at least 2 of the selected keyframes. Fix $n_f=4$ keyframes from the $N$ selected keyframes (randomly chosen) to be used in loss but not optimized. Allow each landmark to be observed by a fixed subset of keyframes in the local window, selected based on covisibility, to enable efficient GPU kernels for residual and Jacobian computation [S2].
